        "original_id": "44d0abcd-bbd2-5b18-bd2f-4fac3c43db65",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Bambra, Steve Jackson, Ian Livingstone, Graeme Morris, Phil Gallagher\n- Products: Dungeons & Dragons, Fighting Fantasy, Warhammer, Night's Dark Terror, Eye of the Dragon, Star Wars\n\nFacts:\n- Fighting Fantasy is a series of single-player role-playing gamebooks created by Steve Jackson and Ian Livingstone.\n- Eye of the Dragon is part of the Fighting Fantasy series by Steve Jackson and Ian Livingstone.\n- Night's Dark Terror is an adventure module for the Dungeons & Dragons fantasy role-playing game written by Jim Bambra, Graeme Morris, and Phil Gallagher.\n- Jim Bambra is particularly known for contributions to Dungeons & Dragons, Fighting Fantasy, Warhammer, and a work based on the Star Wars films.",
